/mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>\u00b1</mo><msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>\u22c5</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>\u22c5</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>\u22c5</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>\u00b1</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, we need to integrate from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"81\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden